const paths={all:['汇水条件与坡体','排水、填筑与支护配合','共同改善工程条件'],north:['北侧低洼区','填筑整治与混凝土护坡','减少积水滞留条件'],grid:['南侧回填坡体','坡面格构梁布设','与锚索等措施协同支护'],anchors:['坡面支护','锚索连接内部锚固段','在支护与岩土体间传递作用'],drain:['坡面与周边汇水','汇入周边排水沟','沿沟道引导排出'],mesh:['裸露填土表面','尼龙网覆盖坡面','保护土表并配合排水']};
export function setupMeasureEffects(){
 const panel=document.querySelector('#measure-model'),sequence=document.createElement('ol');sequence.className='measure-action-path';sequence.setAttribute('aria-label','工程措施作用路径');panel.querySelector('.measure-plain').before(sequence);
 const svg=panel.querySelector('svg');svg.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend','<g class="care-effect-labels" aria-hidden="true"><g data-effect="drain"><path d="M276 300L260 399M650 424L690 443" fill="none" stroke="#a8ece0" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="7 5"/><path d="M255 389L260 399L267 391M681 434L690 443L678 443" fill="none" stroke="#e9fff3" stroke-width="2"/><text x="217" y="418">引导排水</text><text x="686" y="466">排出</text></g><g data-effect="anchors"><ellipse cx="413" cy="319" rx="70" ry="42" fill="none" stroke="#e8d3a3" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 5"/><text x="332" y="382">锚索与内部岩土联系</text></g><g data-effect="grid"><text x="669" y="304">格构梁 · 坡面支护</text></g><g data-effect="north"><text x="335" y="168">低洼区填筑与护坡</text></g><g data-effect="mesh"><text x="633" y="346">覆盖裸露坡面</text></g></g>');
 function paint(){const key=panel.dataset.measure||'all';sequence.innerHTML=paths[key].map((text,i)=>`<li><small>0${i+1}</small><span>${text}</span></li>`).join('');svg.querySelectorAll('[data-effect]').forEach(g=>g.classList.toggle('effect-selected',g.dataset.effect===key));panel.dataset.effect=key;}
 new MutationObserver(paint).observe(panel,{attributes:true,attributeFilter:['data-measure']});paint();
}
